  <title>Flat Review Commands</title>
  <p>
    Orca's <link xref="howto_flat_review">Flat Review</link> commands are
    designed for spatially reviewing elements displayed on the screen. They
    also provide a means for reading the current line, word, and character
    when navigating in the text of a document. Most of these commands are
    "bound" to keystrokes. Please see <link xref="howto_key_bindings">Modifying
    Keybindings</link> for information on how to bind unbound commands.
  </p>
  <section id="line">
    <title>Commands for Reviewing by Line</title>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>First line (The "home" position):</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP 7</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>U</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Baris sebelumnya:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 7</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>U</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Baris ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 8</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>I</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
        <item><p>Eja baris ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 8</key></keyseq> (klik-ganda)</p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>I</key></keyseq> (klik-ganda)</p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Mengeja secara fonetis baris saat ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 8</key></keyseq> (klik tiga kali)</p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>I</key> </keyseq> (klik-tiga-kali)</p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Baris berikutnya:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 9</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>O</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Baris terakhir (posisi "akhir"):</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP 9</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>O</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
  <section id="word">
    <title>Perintah untuk Meninjau per Kata</title>
    <list>
      <item><p>Kata di atas:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP 4</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>J</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Kata sebelumnya:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 4</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>J</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Kata saat ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 5</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>K</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Eja kata ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 5</key></keyseq> (klik-ganda)</p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>K</key></keyseq> (klik-ganda)</p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Mengeja secara fonetis kata saat ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 5</key></keyseq> (klik-tiga-kali)</p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq> <key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>K</key></keyseq> (klik-tiga-kali)</p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Kata berikutnya:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 6</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>L</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Kata di bawah:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP 6</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>L</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
  <section id="character">
    <title>Perintah untuk Meninjau per Karakter</title>
    <list>
      <item><p>Karakter sebelumnya:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 1</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>M</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Karakter saat ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 2</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Koma</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Ucapkan karakter saat ini secara fonetik:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 2</key></keyseq> (klik-ganda)</p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Koma</key> </keyseq> (klik-ganda)</p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Ucapkan nilai Unicode karakter saat ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 2</key></keyseq> (klik-tiga-kali)</p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Koma</key> </keyseq> (klik-tiga-kali)</p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Karakter berikutnya:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP 3</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Titik</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Karakter terakhir pada baris saat ini:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP 1</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>M</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
  <section id="other">
    <title>Perintah Tambahan</title>
    <list>
      <item><p>Toggle flat review (refreshes the flat review context):</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP Kurangi</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>P</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Review current item/widget:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP 5</key></keyseq></p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>K</key></keyseq></p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item><p>Use Say All to review the current dialog or window:</p>
        <list>
          <item><p>Desktop: <key>KP Plus</key> (klik ganda)</p></item>
          <item><p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Titik Koma</key></keyseq> (klik ganda)</p></item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
      <p>
        Copy the contents under flat review to the clipboard: (Unbound)
      </p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>
          Append the contents under flat review to the clipboard: (Unbound)
      </p>
      </item>
      <item><p>Move flat review to the bottom left: (Unbound)</p></item>
      <item><p>Show flat review contents: (Unbound)</p></item>
      <item><p>Toggle restricting flat review to the current object: (Unbound)</p></item>
    </list>
  </section>
</page>
